      "description": "A terminal demo. Start two Kafka-compatible clusters (Redpanda in the demo) and kaf-mirror with Docker Compose, log in with mirror-cli, add a source and a target cluster, create and start a job, produce orders to the source, read them from the target and check the job status.",
